msgstr "Com es mostra la feina"

msgid "I have read the safety sheet"
msgstr "He llegit la fitxa de seguretat"

msgid "In a few words, as it will read in a list."
msgstr "En poques paraules, com es llegirà en una llista."

msgid ""
"In groups, grouped_table does the same with one tbody per group and a "
"header row that says what the group holds. Planning uses it."
msgstr ""
"En grups, grouped_table fa el mateix amb un tbody per grup i una fila de "
"capçalera que diu què conté el grup. Planificació el fa servir."

msgid "In progress"
msgstr "En curs"

msgid "In service"
msgstr "En servei"

msgid "Inspections"
msgstr "Inspeccions"

msgid ""
"It has its icon and its words, so it does not depend on colour. Every "
"field macro writes it and ties it to the control."
msgstr ""
"Té la seva icona i les seves paraules, així que no depèn del color. Cada "
"macro de camp l'escriu i el vincula al control."

msgid ""
"It uses Tailwind's own colours, which this base removes, so some colours "
"differ from the published example."
msgstr ""
"Fa servir els colors propis de Tailwind, que aquesta base elimina, de "
"manera que alguns colors difereixen de l'exemple publicat."

